window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-55cdea3737e39583"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"speed\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">速度</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>在 Codex 中，你可以通过增加用量消耗来提高模型速度。</p> <p><a id=\"fast-mode\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"fast\">Fast 模式</h2> <p>Fast 模式可加速支持该模式的模型，包括 GPT-6.1 Sol、GPT-6 Astra、GPT-6 Sol 和 GPT-6 Luna（具体取决于可用情况）。GPT-5.6 的速度提升为 1.5 倍。</p> <p>在 CLI 中使用 <code>/fast</code> 开启或关闭 Fast 模式。使用 <code>/statusline</code> 在页脚显示 Fast 状态。你也可以在 <code>config.toml</code> 中设置 <code>service_tier = \"fast\"</code> 和 <code>[features].fast_mode = true</code>，将其设为默认值。使用 ChatGPT 登录时，ChatGPT 桌面应用、Codex CLI 和 IDE 扩展都可使用 Fast 模式。</p> <p>对于受支持的模型，Fast 模式会以 Standard 用量速率的 2.5 倍消耗订阅内含额度。已购额度和 Enterprise 按量付费的用量则按 Standard 速率的 2 倍计费。</p> <p><a id=\"astra-ultrafast\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"ultrafast-mode\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"ultrafast\">Ultrafast 模式</h2>  <p>Ultrafast 支持 GPT-6 Astra 和 GPT-6.1 Sol。</p> <p>GPT-6 Astra 的 Ultrafast 模式在 Codex 中的词元（token）生成速度最高可达其 Standard 模式的 8 倍。</p> <p>Pro $500 套餐以及符合条件的 Enterprise 和 Edu 套餐可在 Codex 和 ChatGPT Work 中使用 Ultrafast。在 Pro $500 套餐中，Ultrafast 会先使用订阅内含额度；该额度用完后，再使用可用积分。</p> <p>Ultrafast 模式下，已购额度和 Enterprise 按量付费的用量按 Standard 费率的 6 倍计费；订阅内含用量限制则按 Standard 速率的 8 倍消耗。</p> <p>对于 Enterprise 工作区，Ultrafast 默认关闭。工作区所有者可以通过<a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">工作区权限</a>为指定用户或整个工作区启用访问权限。现有的<a href=\"#/article/a-48de7f90f27343f8\">按用户支出控制</a>也适用于符合条件的 Ultrafast 用量。</p> <p><a id=\"availability-and-billing-details\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">可用性和计费详情</h2> <p><strong>ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 共享用量。</strong> 两者共用相同的计费规则、积分和用量限制。详情请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">Codex 定价</a>。</p> <p>请查看<a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">模型</a>页面了解模型可用性，并查看<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=token-rates\">定价</a>了解词元费率。</p> <p><a id=\"ultrafast-plan-and-workspace-requirements\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"ultrafast_1\">Ultrafast 的套餐与工作区要求</h3> <ul> <li>符合条件的 Enterprise 工作区使用积分或美元用量计费协议；费用按工作区协议结算。</li> <li>符合条件的 Edu 套餐使用积分。依赖速率限制、而非按用量计费的旧版 Enterprise 套餐不受支持。</li> </ul> <p>Ultrafast 推出时，其他自助服务套餐无法使用该功能，即使已购买积分也不例外。</p> <p>GPT-6.1 Sol 的 Ultrafast 模式支持美国和欧洲（欧洲经济区 EEA + 瑞士）的推理数据驻留；GPT-6 Astra 的 Ultrafast 模式仅支持美国的推理数据驻留。</p> <p><a id=\"api-billing\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"api\">API 计费</h3> <p>使用 API 密钥时，Codex 按 API 词元费率计费，不适用 ChatGPT 积分倍率。</p> <p>有关 API 可用性、请求配置和价格，请参阅 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/ultrafast-mode.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">API 中的 Ultrafast 模式</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"retirement-and-migration\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">退役与迁移</h2> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-55-retirement\">GPT-5.5 自 2026 年 10 月 14 日太平洋时间中午（19:00 UTC）起，已从使用 ChatGPT 登录的 Codex 中退役</a>。OpenAI API 和使用 API 密钥认证的 Codex 会话不受影响。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"speed\">Speed</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>You can increase model speed in Codex in exchange for higher usage.</p> <h2 id=\"fast-mode\">Fast mode</h2> <p>Fast mode speeds up supported models, including GPT-6.1 Sol, GPT-6 Astra, GPT-6 Sol, and GPT-6 Luna, where available. For GPT-5.6, the speed increase is 1.5x.</p> <p>Use <code>/fast</code> in the CLI to toggle Fast mode. Use <code>/statusline</code> to show it in the footer. You can also persist the default with <code>service_tier = \"fast\"</code> plus <code>[features].fast_mode = true</code> in <code>config.toml</code>. Fast mode is available in the ChatGPT desktop app, Codex CLI, and IDE extension when you sign in with ChatGPT.</p> <p>For supported models, Fast mode uses included subscription limits at 2.5x the Standard rate. Purchased credits and Enterprise pay-as-you-go usage are billed at 2x the Standard rate.</p> <p><a id=\"astra-ultrafast\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"ultrafast-mode\">Ultrafast mode</h2>  <p>Ultrafast supports GPT-6 Astra and GPT-6.1 Sol.</p> <p>GPT-6 Astra Ultrafast generates tokens up to 8x faster than GPT-6 Astra in Standard mode in Codex.</p> <p>Ultrafast is available in Codex and ChatGPT Work on Pro $500 and eligible Enterprise and Edu plans. On Pro $500, Ultrafast uses your included usage first, then your available credits after that allowance runs out.</p> <p>Ultrafast mode bills purchased credits and Enterprise pay-as-you-go usage at 6x the Standard rate. Ultrafast uses included subscription limits at 8x the Standard rate.</p> <p>For Enterprise workspaces, Ultrafast is off by default. Workspace owners can enable access for selected users or the workspace through <a href=\"#/article/a-a292ca32ae057ed8\">workspace permissions</a>. Existing <a href=\"#/article/a-48de7f90f27343f8\">per-user spend controls</a> apply to eligible Ultrafast usage.</p> <h2 id=\"availability-and-billing-details\">Availability and billing details</h2> <p><strong>ChatGPT Work and Codex share usage.</strong> Both use the same pricing, credits, and usage limits. See <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7\">Codex pricing</a> for details.</p> <p>See <a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938\">Models</a> for model availability and <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=token-rates\">Pricing</a> for token rates.</p> <h3 id=\"ultrafast-plan-and-workspace-requirements\">Ultrafast plan and workspace requirements</h3> <ul> <li>Eligible Enterprise workspaces use credit-based or USD usage-based agreements. Usage is billed according to the workspace's agreement.</li> <li>Eligible Edu plans use credits. Legacy Enterprise plans that rely on rate limits instead of usage-based billing aren't supported.</li> </ul> <p>Other self-serve plans don't have access to Ultrafast at launch, even with purchased credits.</p> <p>GPT-6.1 Sol Ultrafast supports inference residency in the United States and Europe (EEA + Switzerland). GPT-6 Astra Ultrafast supports inference residency in the United States only.</p> <h3 id=\"api-billing\">API billing</h3> <p>With an API key, Codex uses API token pricing instead, and ChatGPT credit multipliers don't apply.</p> <p>For API availability, request configuration, and pricing, see <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/ultrafast-mode.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ultrafast mode in the API</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"retirement-and-migration\">Retirement and migration</h2> <p><a href=\"#/article/a-ae24d057324a4938?anchor=gpt-55-retirement\">GPT-5.5 retires</a> from Codex with ChatGPT sign-in on October 14, 2026, at noon PDT (19:00 UTC). The OpenAI API and Codex sessions authenticated with an API key aren't affected.</p>"};
